00:24:05,280 --> 00:24:10,560
Um, and, um, what you'll do is when you, when you detect a wildcard, um, when you're doing

485
00:24:10,560 --> 00:24:16,860
subdomain enumeration, um, you, you will take that wildcard and put it through a process

486
00:24:16,860 --> 00:24:20,040
to create a profile for what this specific wildcard looks like.

487
00:24:20,460 --> 00:24:25,220
So you're generating multiple, um, iterations.

488
00:24:25,220 --> 00:24:26,520
You're resolving it multiple times.

